/// files }. It shows once its own files have arrived, up to 32 MB in total and 8 MB per file, while
/// the rest downloads. LoadingScreen.show(url) can replace it later, once resources have started.
/// The page is an unfocused, full-screen web view of your client resource. It receives the window
/// event 'kcdsLoading' with detail { stage, percent }, where stage is 'download', with
/// resourcesDone, resourcesTotal, bytesDone and bytesTotal too, 'resources', 'level' or 'ready'. It
